WEBVTT

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:01.430
So you mentioned
your expertise in innovation.

00:19:01.463 --> 00:19:04.730
You have a couple of lines of --
how to say it? --

00:19:04.763 --> 00:19:06.830
of exquisite modesty in the book

00:19:06.863 --> 00:19:08.830
where you say you think like an engineer,

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.530
you don't know much about politics,

00:19:10.563 --> 00:19:13.597
but actually you talk to top politicians
more than any of us.

00:19:13.597 --> 00:19:17.097
What do you ask them
and what do you hear in return?

00:19:17.097 --> 00:19:20.963
Gates: Well, they’re mostly responding
to voters interest.

00:19:20.997 --> 00:19:24.730
Most of the countries
we're talking about are democracies.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.830
And you know,

00:19:27.863 --> 00:19:32.397
there are resources
that will need to be put in